From 16dad80fe1ec4d329828ef27a376a7870056df10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:02:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 39/69] arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-motorola-nairo: Enable the GPU

Enable the GPU and GMU, and point the zap shader at the device-specific
signed firmware from the stock vendor image.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts
index 0f995d544..e2e49bc27 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts
@@ -230,6 +230,18 @@ vreg_l9c_2p96: ldo9 {
 	};
 };
 
+&gmu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&gpu_zap_shader {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm7250/motorola/nairo/a620_zap.mdt";
+};
+
 &pm7250b_charger {
 	monitored-battery = <&battery>;
 
